#chip mega328p, 16

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): A long constant Wait written in microseconds (Wait 10000 us) is built inline and is exact at any size. A constant Wait in ms/10ms/s is also built inline now (see the RepeatFor_WaitMs_* files), up to 8,000,000 cycles
'Expect: compiles, and the Repeat For construct runs exactly the requested number of clock cycles (cycle-accurate simulation)

#option explicit
Repeat For 1 s
    Wait 10000 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
